id=dumbdown_hide_smart_txt
name=DumbDown Hide Smart Txt
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=1
author=amber
description=Hides the DumbDown Launcher's smart txt (OpenBubbles / Google Messages) and contact sync tiles by setting the app's own hide_smart_txt=true preference. Works alongside DumbDown Plan Unlock: when that module is active it writes the value itself (so the two never race on the prefs file) and this module only acts as the switch; on its own this module writes the value directly. Remove it to bring the tiles back.
